sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant User
    participant Claude as Claude Code
    participant File as issue-N.md
    participant Codex

    User->>Claude: /scope #N
    Claude->>Claude: AskUserQuestion alignment
    Claude->>File: Original Requirements + Codebase Exploration
    File-->>User: scope ready
    User->>Codex: /architect #N
    Codex->>File: Architecture Plan - Attempt 1
    Codex-->>User: READY TO BUILD
    loop until APPROVE
        User->>Claude: /build #N
        Claude->>File: Implementation Notes - Attempt N
        Claude-->>User: build done
        User->>Codex: /review #N
        Codex->>File: GPT Review - Attempt N
        Codex-->>User: APPROVE / REQUEST CHANGES / BLOCK
    end
    User->>Claude: /verify #N
    Claude->>Claude: address remaining issues, run tests
    Claude->>Claude: generate Manual Test Plan
    Claude-->>User: ━ HITL: walk through manual plan ━
    User->>Claude: signed off
    Claude->>File: Verification & Commit
    Claude-->>User: committed, issue closed
